      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a series of frustrating changes at work which are certainly concerning. In situations like these, it may be helpful to address your concerns directly with HR, or someone at your workplace, such as your manager or a trusted coworker. It's important to keep them informed in a calm and professional manner to understand what is happening and find a way to work through these issues. If you feel comfortable, gather any evidence you have about the events you've mentioned, and present them clearly during your conversation. Remember to keep track of all communication regarding this matter as it may be useful later on.",
